WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.315
MIX. Add dry sand to clear water in a labelled jar.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.464
SETTLE. Show sand particles collecting at the jar bottom.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:11.547
POUR. Illustrate careful decanting while sediment remains.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:17.295
FILTER. Contrast capturing undissolved sand with dissolved salt remaining in water.
